					Comment for Type of Reporting Person:
				</div><div class="largetext" style="text-align:justify">Items 8,10,11* Includes (i) 5,813,286 Common Shares of the Issuer issued to TVF (as defined herein) and (ii) 67,494 Common Shares of the Issuer issued to TVPF (as defined herein). TMC (as defined herein) has voting and dispositive power of the Common Shares held by TVF and TVPF and therefore may be deemed to be the beneficial owner of such Common Shares.

